                                                                       "Majlinda Llugiqi",
                                                                       "Laura Waltersdorfer",
                                                                       "Marta Sabou",
                                                                       "Anna Breit";
                                    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An ontology to describe a Semantic-Web Machine Learning System (SWeMLS)"@en;
